# What is sent to the build of the Dastan image: the build settings of the repository, the shared libraries and
# the app. Everything else stays out – other apps, tests, outputs, and the collection itself: an image holds no
# content, and the working files of the editors never leave the repository this way.
*

!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Build.targets
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!nuget.config
!.editorconfig
!eng
!src/Libraries
!src/Apps/Dastan

eng/benchmarks
eng/hosting
eng/native
eng/sync
eng/tests
src/Apps/Dastan/content
src/Apps/Dastan/docs
**/bin
**/obj
